<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all three auctions whereby it had sought to drain 1.545 billion pesos from the secondary market on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM    AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    472 million    7 days  25.00 pct</p>
<p>    473 million    4 days  24.50 pct</p>
<p>    600 million    1 day   24.47 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
